<p>Tom publishes the code so people can inspect how figade handles their files. The figade code is copyrighted and is not released under an open-source licence; publishing it for transparency does not offer general permission to reuse or redistribute it. See the <a href="https://github.com/TomsCoolTools/figade/blob/main/LICENSE">repository licence</a>. Third-party components keep their own licences.</p>
